<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov 1-20 grain exports at 554,678 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov 1-20 grain exports at 554,678 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 554,678 tonnes between November 1 and November 20, French port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 336,000 tonnes in the whole of November 1995.</p>
<p>The 554,678 tonne total included 491,235 tonnes of wheat, 62,143 of barley and 1,300 of maize destined for La Reunion.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)-</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		     28,000</p>
<p>    Albania			    6,800</p>
<p>    Egypt			     71,076</p>
<p>    Britain			   12,175</p>
<p>    Ireland			    1,500</p>
<p>    Italy			    134,148</p>
<p>    Kuwait			    26,250</p>
<p>    Morocco			   89,550</p>
<p>    Poland			    86,016</p>
<p>    Sudan			     27,500</p>
<p>    Turkey			     8,220</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    55,000</p>
<p>    Greece			     2,750</p>
<p>    Italy				3,393</p>
<p>    West Africa			1,000</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
